252
00:10:59,322 --> 00:11:01,762
called your Light Cone.

253
00:11:01,942 --> 00:11:05,612
Everything inside the bottom cone is your observable

254
00:11:05,462 --> 00:11:08,352
past events close enough that their light has

255
00:11:08,202 --> 00:11:09,542
