256
00:11:09,622 --> 00:11:12,572
Everything inside the top cone is your reachable

257
00:11:13,132 --> 00:11:17,332
future events your actions right now can still

258
00:11:17,182 --> 00:11:17,392
influence.

259
00:11:17,542 --> 00:11:21,742
Everything outside both cones is a vast no-man's-land

260
00:11:21,772 --> 00:11:24,242
physicists call Elsewhere.

261
00:11:24,182 --> 00:11:27,192
And where does Andromeda's right now sit?

262
00:11:27,342 --> 00:11:29,562
Deep inside Elsewhere.

263
00:11:29,742 --> 00:11:32,582
Neither walker can receive a single photon from

264
00:11:32,432 --> 00:11:34,812
that alien vote for another two and a

265
00:11:34,662 --> 00:11:36,762
half million years.

266
00:11:36,702 --> 00:11:39,562
By the time that light finally arrives at

267
00:11:39,412 --> 00:11:42,222
Earth, both friends and every observer in the

268
00:11:42,072 --> 00:11:46,412
universe agree completely on what happened and in

269
00:11:46,262 --> 00:11:47,632
what order.

270
00:11:47,502 --> 00:11:51,462
Inside the light cone, cause always comes before

271
00:11:51,312 --> 00:11:54,372
effect no matter how fast you move, and

272
00:11:54,222 --> 00:11:57,432
no matter which one-way speed of light rule

